 "result": "In `src/tessel/helpers.py:360-399`, `get_flashed_messages` filters like this:\n\n```python\nif category_filter:\n    flashes = list(filter(lambda f: f[0] in category_filter, flashes))\n```\n\n- Each flash is a `(category, message)` tuple, and only tuples whose category (`f[0]`) is in `category_filter` are kept.\n- An empty filter (the default) skips filtering and returns everything.\n- The filter runs before the output shape is chosen: `with_categories=False` returns just the message strings, and `True` returns the filtered tuples.\n\nThe flashes are popped from the session once and cached on `app_ctx._flashes`. Repeated calls in the same request see the same list, and each call applies its own filter.",
